<title>ARGENTINA: South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</title>
<headline>South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South American vegoil and subproduct export offer/bid prices at close October 11 as quoted by the J.J. Hinrichsen brokerage (in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p> ARGENTINA, FOB Argentine ports</p>
<p> Peanutoil  Jan/Mar 820/800</p>
<p> Soy oil    Oct 495/490 Nov/Dec -10/-35</p>
<p> Sunoil     Oct 498/490 Nov/Dec</p>
<p> Linsd oil  Oct 490/480</p>
<p> Ctnsd oil  unq</p>
</text>
